{"PageNumber":530,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":54,"SurahIndex":"054","VerseNumber":28,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَنَبِّئۡهُمۡ أَنَّ ٱلۡمَآءَ قِسۡمَةُۢ بَيۡنَهُمۡۖ كُلُّ شِرۡبٖ مُّحۡتَضَرٞ","TajweedText":"وَنَبِّئْهُمْ أَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْم<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءَ قِسْمَ<tajweed class=iqlab>ةُۢ ب</tajweed>َيْنَهُمْ‌ۖ كُلُّ شِرْ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>بٍ م</tajweed>ُّحْتَضَرٌ <span class=end>٢٨</span>","End":"٢٨","PageNumber":530,"JuzNumber":27,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":464,"MaqraNumber":212,"HizbNumber":53,"HizbDecimal":0.75,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":54,"SurahIndex":"054","VerseNumber":29,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَنَادَوۡاْ صَاحِبَهُمۡ فَتَعَاطَىٰ فَعَقَرَ","TajweedText":"فَنَادَوْ<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> صَاحِبَهُمْ فَتَعَاطَىٰ فَعَقَرَ <span class=end>٢٩</span>","End":"٢٩","PageNumber":530,"JuzNumber":27,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":464,"MaqraNumber":212,"HizbNumber":53,"HizbDecimal":0.75,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":54,"SurahIndex":"054","VerseNumber":30,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَكَيۡفَ كَانَ عَذَابِي وَنُذُرِ","TajweedText":"فَكَيْفَ كَانَ عَذَابِى وَنُذُرِ <span class=end>٣٠</span>","End":"٣٠","PageNumber":530,"JuzNumber":27,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":464,"MaqraNumber":212,"HizbNumber":53,"HizbDecimal":0.75,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":54,"SurahIndex":"054","VerseNumber":31,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"إِنَّآ أَرۡسَلۡنَا عَلَيۡهِمۡ صَيۡحَةٗ وَٰحِدَةٗ فَكَانُواْ كَهَشِيمِ ٱلۡمُحۡتَظِرِ","TajweedText":"إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed><tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أَرْسَلْنَا عَلَيْهِمْ صَيْحَ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ةً و</tajweed><tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>حِدَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ةً ف</tajweed>َكَانُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> كَهَشِيمِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمُحْتَظِرِ <span class=end>٣١<